OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786816101
OL,3,CPictures show damage after carriages
OL,4,Coverturn in Lewes train derailment
OL,6,FAerial shots taken have revealed the
OL,7,Fextent of damage to which a train
OL,8,Fwhich derailed in East Sussex on
OL,9,FThursday afternoon.
OL,11,FThree carriages came off the tracks
OL,12,Fand overturned near Lewes, trapping
OL,13,Fpassengers on board the Southern train.
OL,15,FAround 150 people had been onboard the
OL,16,Fservice travelling from London
OL,17,FVictoria to Eastbourne and were
OL,18,Fevacuated.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
