OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786816101
OL,3,CPictures show damage after carriages
OL,4,Coverturn in Lewes train derailment
OL,6,FA major incident was declared by
OL,7,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) and
OL,8,Fmultiple emergency services were sent
OL,9,Fto the scene.
OL,11,FTwo people were seriously injured and
OL,12,Fa total of 20 people were taken to
OL,13,Fhospital to be treated.
OL,15,FThe two passengers are not deemed to
OL,16,Fbe in a life-threatening condition,
OL,17,FBTP have said.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
