CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786816101
OL,3,CPictures show damage after carriages
OL,4,Coverturn in Lewes train derailment
OL,6,FA statement said: "They both remain in
OL,7,Fhospital and the 18 people who were
OL,8,Falso treated at hospital for less
OL,9,Fserious injuries have been discharged."
OL,11,FAssistant Chief Constable Ian Drummond-
OL,12,FSmith added: "Our thoughts remain
OL,13,Ffirmly with those who were injured and
OL,14,Ftheir loved ones. On behalf of BTP, I
OL,15,Fwish them a full and speedy recovery."
OL,26,@nD@SOUqD@gO]tD@NOUwD@fO]
