PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786816101
OL,3,CPictures show damage after carriages
OL,4,Coverturn in Lewes train derailment
OL,6,FToday, another train has derailed in
OL,7,FEssex in a second incident. It
OL,8,Fhappened in Wickford in Essex this
OL,9,Fafternoon at 2.12pm. British Transport
OL,10,FPolice said that there were no
OL,11,Freported injuries.
OL,13,FThe derailment in Sussex has caused
OL,14,Fmajor travel disruption today while
OL,15,Fspecialist teams continue emergency
OL,16,Fresponse, recovery and investigation
OL,17,Fwork.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
