PN,38705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786816101
OL,3,CPictures show damage after carriages
OL,4,Coverturn in Lewes train derailment
OL,6,FThe force is appealing for anyone on
OL,7,Fboard the derailed train who have not
OL,8,Falready spoken to police to come
OL,9,Fforward.
OL,11,FOfficers said many passengers left the
OL,12,Farea and took alternative routes home
OL,13,Fafter they were evacuated.
OL,15,FMr Drummond-Smith said the public can
OL,16,Fexpect to see a "continued police
OL,17,Fpresence" at the scene in the coming
OL,18,Fdays as the Rail Accident
OL,19,FInvestigations Bureau's (RAIB)
OL,20,Finvestigation into the cause continues.
OL,26,@xD@QOUyD@IO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/8
