CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786816101
OL,3,CPictures show damage after carriages
OL,4,Coverturn in Lewes train derailment
OL,6,FThe senior officer also paid tribute
OL,7,Fto communities and emergency services
OL,8,Fwho responded to the derailment.
OL,10,F"Local Lewes residents and business
OL,11,Fowners came out in their droves to
OL,12,Fsupport affected passengers, providing
OL,13,Fwater and refreshments in extremely
OL,14,Fhot conditions," he said.
OL,16,F"My thanks and appreciation go to
OL,17,Fthem, as well as our officers and
OL,18,Femergency service colleagues whose
OL,19,Fprofessionalism ensured those on board
OL,20,Fwere brought to safety in incredibly
OL,21,Fchallenging circumstances."
OL,26,@rD@AOUvD@PO]xD@AOU}D@[O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
