CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786816101
OL,3,CPictures show damage after carriages
OL,4,Coverturn in Lewes train derailment
OL,6,FJohn Whitehurst, chief executive of
OL,7,FGTR, which operates Southern, said on
OL,8,FFriday that derailments are
OL,9,F"incredibly rare", adding that what
OL,10,Fhappened near Lewes "was a very
OL,11,Fserious incident and I'm deeply
OL,12,Fsaddened by it".
OL,14,FAsked on the BBC Radio 4's Today
OL,15,FProgramme if the railway was safe in
OL,16,Fhot weather, Mr Whitehurst said: "The
OL,17,Frailway is safe. These types of
OL,18,Fincidents are incredibly rare.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@QO]rD@UOUtD@OO]xD@bOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
