OL,3,CPictures show damage after carriages
OL,4,Coverturn in Lewes train derailment
OL,6,F"We have control processes in place
OL,7,Fthat involve inspection, temporary
OL,8,Fspeed restrictions or even suspending
OL,9,Fservices if that's required."
OL,11,FSouthern says they will provide
OL,12,Ffurther updates on travel disruption
OL,13,Fas more information becomes available.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@]O]
